{
	"SchemaName": "PNC_ClaimLevel",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"//": [
		"PNC 'Claim Level' sheet. Mapping per AveragesTable_AllAccounts_Field Mapping_V1.21.xlsx,",
		"ClaimLevelFactTable, column 'PNC'.",
		"Each column is a source header; where it is not already a COMMON alias, Aliases names the COMMON",
		"column it feeds - a lab-only alias group, so ClaimLevel.schema.json is unchanged for other labs.",
		"ClinicName <- 'Sales Rep Facility' and SalesRepname <- 'Sales Rep' (V1.21). 'Service Facility' is",
		"Facility and 'Rendering Provider' has no COMMON column; both are appended raw.",
		"Panelname <- 'Service Type'. ICDCode <- 'Diagnosis Codes'. 'Policy ID' is the subscriber id.",
		"DenialCode <- 'Denial Code' (declared so nothing else is tried when it is blank); 'Updated Denial",
		"Code' is appended raw.",
		"'Claim Level CPT' feeds 'CPT Code X Units X Modifier Orginal'; the COMMON 'CPT Code X Units X",
		"Modifier' is rebuilt from the line level after export. 'CPT / Procedure', 'Units' and 'Modifiers'",
		"are appended raw (CPTCodeList / UnitsList / ModifierList).",
		"'Deposit Date' is CheckDate and 'Posted Date' is Payment Posted Date (both COMMON aliases).",
		"'Posted Date' is deliberately NOT declared: it is also a COMMON CheckDate alias, and declaring it",
		"would let a blank Deposit Date fall back to the posted date.",
		"'Aging' is the DOS aging bucket and feeds the COMMON 'Aging DOS' column.",
		"'Write Off' is InsuranceAdjustments and 'Patient Responsibility' is PatientBalance (V1.21); the",
		"COMMON TotalPayments / TotalAdjustments / Total Balance are calculated.",
		"'Status' is the billing system's claim status and is kept raw; ClaimStatus is 'Claim Status'."
	],
	"Columns": [
